# 🛒 Superstore Sales Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview
This project explores the Superstore Sales dataset using Python to uncover sales trends, customer behavior, and business performance. The analysis includes data cleaning, exploration, aggregation, and visualization to generate actionable insights.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

## 📊 Analysis Workflow
- Data Exploration
- Data Cleaning
- Data Filtering
- Data Sorting
- Data Aggregation & Grouping
- Data Visualization
- Business Insights

## 📈 Key Findings
- The **Consumer** segment contributes **50.76%** of total sales.
- **Technology** is the highest-performing product category.
- The **West** region generates the highest overall sales.
- Sales show a consistent upward trend between **2015 and 2018**.

## 📷 Visualizations
The notebook includes charts that highlight sales trends and category performance to support the findings.

